# cahunTags: tags, validation certificates, invalidating, party hunting and mandatory hunter
# reporting. Sources: O. Reg. 665/98 ss. 14 to 21, 24.1 to 24.6, 25.1, 58 to 62; Hunting
# Regulations Summary 2026 (tags, general regulations, mandatory hunter reporting).
